        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "That being so, there is no reason to interfere with the actions initiated by the Designated Officer in co-ordination with the Food Safety Officer by collecting the samples and https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis sent the same for Food Analysis "
      },
      {
