        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is no irregularity on the part Sri Venkatachalapathy Rice And Sago ... vs Commissioner Of Food Safety on 3 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/60519769/\n3 of the respondents in complying with the provisions of th"
      },
